187688_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=tusb9sPXNxYQ7kNvwFUSh3w&_nc_oc=AdnJzbwkUwHBi599tkpFVJcg9mB971H7OjmEVqFJ5FKLvBEsz0FsMIkEEpp5P672sH0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afuc_pDI0txnnMx4i33WeL4Abce7a7B4uowQJoNaEaY81w&oe=6999BC88"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "LandScape.png", "id": "4526900444203911", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491830904_4526900447537244_1593155788570280980_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=pspti8GFEHkQ7kNvwGmPeEV&_nc_oc=Admn3w4wOHFCUej05hbgIiEWouYmQz-JJAinWCIAab7qf7oeuV5e_yRtBkivEsh3-4Y&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftUj8Ztk9Rm9KV_qqoNrnxfLIy2WqDohweZIhesAtqEXA&oe=6999B366"}, "display_name": "The Historical Art Gallery", "keywords": ["AI", "Gallery", "Art", "Paintings", "History"], "long_description": "The Historical Art Gallery is a collection of famous historical paintings like:\n- The Scream, by Edvard Munch\n- La Promenade, by Pierre-Auguste Renoir\n- The Music Lesson, by Johannes Vermeer\n- Starry Night Over the Rh\u00f4ne, by Vincent van Gogh\n- Four Seasons in One Head, at and by Giuseppe Arcimboldo\n- In the Loge, by Mary Cassatt\n... and more\n\nHere you have a nice gallery environment setup with the statue of a horse in the middle, as an extra you can see how the AI animate the paintings.", "short_description": "The Historical Art Gallery is a collection of famous historical paintings like:\n- The Scream, by Edvard Munch\n- La Promenade, by Pierre-Auguste Renoir\n- The Music Lesson, by Johannes Vermeer\n- Starry Night Over the Rh\u00f4ne, by Vincent van Gogh\n- Four Seasons in One Head, at and by Giuseppe Arcimboldo\n- In the Loge, by Mary Cassatt\n... and more\n\nHere you have a nice gallery environment setup with the statue of a horse in the middle, as an extra you can see how the AI animate the paintings."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://midicreationsvr.blo